{"id":"2ad7561edabb2148","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-ground-language.md","title":"基础语言","display":"df-ground-language — 基础语言","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-ground-language","aliases":["91-df-ground-language"],"display":"df-ground-language — 基础语言","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-ground-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-ground-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ground-language — 基础语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-ground-language-—-基础语言-$\\mathcal{L}_0$\">df-ground-language — 基础语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_0\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,S,+,\\times,&lt;\">\\(0,S,+,\\times,&lt;\\)</span> (两两不同的非逻辑符号)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ground\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L_0\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal L_0}=\\{0\\},\\\n\\mathrm{Func}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}=\\{S\\},\\\n\\mathrm{Func}^{2}_{\\mathcal L_0}=\\{+,\\times\\},\\\n\\mathrm{Rel}^{2}_{\\mathcal L_0}=\\{&lt;\\}\n\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ground\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L_0\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal L_0}=\\{0\\},\\\n\\mathrm{Func}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}=\\{S\\},\\\n\\mathrm{Func}^{2}_{\\mathcal L_0}=\\{+,\\times\\},\\\n\\mathrm{Rel}^{2}_{\\mathcal L_0}=\\{&lt;\\}\n\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且其余非逻辑符号类为空；等号作为逻辑符号处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_0\\)</span> : 基础语言（算术语言，Peano算术的语言）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}\\)</span> : 常量符号集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Func}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}^n\">\\(\\mathrm{Func}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}^n\\)</span> : n元函数符号集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}^n\">\\(\\mathrm{Rel}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}^n\\)</span> : n元关系符号集</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：基础语言是标准一阶算术语言，用于表达Peano算术PA。真理谓词扩展的基础语言在此基础上添加真理谓词T。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-ground-language-—-基础语言-$\\mathcal{L}_0$","text":"df-ground-language — 基础语言 $\\mathcal{L}_0$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_0","display":false},{"tex":"0,S,+,\\times,<","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ground\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L_0\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal L_0}=\\{0\\},\\\n\\mathrm{Func}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}=\\{S\\},\\\n\\mathrm{Func}^{2}_{\\mathcal L_0}=\\{+,\\times\\},\\\n\\mathrm{Rel}^{2}_{\\mathcal L_0}=\\{<\\}\n\\bigr),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Const}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Func}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rel}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}^n","display":false}],"bytes":1122,"backlinks":[{"id":"84940566355062f6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{L}_0$ (基础语言, see [[91-df-ground-language]])"},{"id":"7dc6a6fb8ddfca30","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{L}_0$ (基础语言, see [[91-df-ground-language]])"},{"id":"b0b2a8b496dd82c3","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · de